  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/3042C3">Corollary <span data-tag="3042C3">2.2.2.10</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a Kan complex. Then the counit map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[ v: | \Sing _{Q^{\bullet }} X|_{Q^{\bullet }} \rightarrow X \]
</div>
  <p> is a weak homotopy equivalence. </p>
